  <metadata>
    <name>Pirāta Tromeļa dārgumu taka (turp un atpakaļ)</name>
    <desc>Published Melnsils–Ēvaži coastal walk. The original GPX includes both outward and return legs, with some different paths. Beaches, forest paths and stream crossings; winter ice may make the route difficult. Published by Martins, Dabastakas.lv. Downloaded 2026-09-05. All source coordinates and recorded elevations preserved; activity timestamps and sensor readings omitted.</desc>
    <author>
      <name>Martins / Dabastakas.lv</name>
    </author>
    <link href="https://dabastakas.lv/marsruti/pirata-tromela-dargumu-taka/" />
    <link href="https://dabastakas.lv/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Pirata_Tromela_dargumu_taka.gpx" />
  </metadata>
